meta {
  name: List Finance Transactions (College Admin)
  type: http
  seq: 4
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/college-admin/payments/finance/transactions
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{staffAccessToken}}
}

params:query {
  page: 1
  limit: 20
  ~from_date: 2026-08-22
  ~to_date: 2026-08-22
  ~course_id: CRM-1
  ~fee_category: tuition_fee
  ~payment_method: mock
}

docs {
  Paginated transaction history for this college's Finance dashboard.
  Requires staff_member auth + finance.view.

  Query (all optional):
  - from_date, to_date (YYYY-MM-DD, filters Transaction.createdAt)
  - course_id — matches transactions whose ledger entry is linked to an
    ApplicationCourse or Enrollment for this course. Transactions with no
    course link (e.g. commute/hostel booking fees) are excluded when this
    filter is set.
  - fee_category — StudentFeeLedger.feeCategory exact match
  - payment_method — "mock" | "demand_draft" | "bank_transfer"
  - page (default 1), limit (default 20, max 100)

  Each row: { id, transactionNumber, time, studentId, studentName,
  feeCategory, paymentMethod, paymentMethodLabel, amount, direction
  ("credit" — refunds aren't merged into this list yet, see below),
  status ("success" | "failed" | "pending") }.

  Response includes `meta` (page, limit, total, totalPages, hasNextPage,
  hasPreviousPage) alongside `data`.

  Scope note: this reads only the `transactions` table (collections).
  Refunds live in a separate `Refund` table and are not unioned into this
  history yet — every row here is a credit.
}
